            "OP is the median, so P is mid-point of AB",
            "OP = ½(OA + OB) = ½(4i + 4k) = 2i + 2k",
            "Area of ||gm = |OA × OP|",
            "|i j k| |1 1 1| |2 0 2|",
            "= i(2 − 0) − j(2 − 2) + k(0 − 2) = 2i − 2k",
            "Area = √(4 + 4) = 2√2 sq. units"
          ],
          "examinerMark": 2,
          "legible": true
        },
        {
          "number": "26A",
          "page": 3,
          "top": 0.33,
          "bottom": 0.48,
          "lines": [
            "x^y = e^(x − y). Taking log: y log x = (x − y) log e",
            "y log x + y = x ⇒ y = x/(1 + log x)",
            "dy/dx = [(1 + log x)·1 − x·(1/x)]/(1 + log x)^2",
            "= log x/(1 + log x)^2 = log x/(log(xe))^2",
            "at x = e: dy/dx = log e/(log e^2)^2 = 1/2"
          ],
          "examinerMark": 2,
          "legible": true
        }
      ]
    },
