          "lines": [
            "Let r = radius of the ice ball at time t.",
            "V = (4/3)πr^3 ...(1)   S = 4πr^2 ...(2)",
            "dV/dt ∝ S ⇒ dV/dt = −kS, k > 0 ...(3)",
            "Differentiating (1) w.r.t. t:",
            "dV/dt = (4/3)π·3r^2·dr/dt = 4πr^2 dr/dt ...(4)",
            "From (3) and (4): −kS = 4πr^2 dr/dt",
            "−kS = S·dr/dt (using (2))",
            "⇒ dr/dt = −k",
            "∴ the radius decreases at a constant rate k."
          ],
          "examinerMark": 1.5,
          "legible": true
        }
      ]
    },
