            "Let A: Mehul selected, B: Rashi selected (independent)",
            "P(A) = 0.4, P(A ∩ B') + P(A' ∩ B) = 0.5",
            "Let P(B) = x",
            "0.4(1 − x) + 0.6x = 0.5",
            "0.4 − 0.4x + 0.6x = 0.5 ⇒ 0.2x = 0.04",
            "x = 0.2 ∴ P(Rashi) = 0.2",
            "P(at least one) = 1 − P(A')P(B')",
            "= 1 − 0.6 × 0.8 = 0.52"
          ],
          "examinerMark": 2,
          "legible": true
        }
      ]
